{"id":"n71070-1-7","stage":1,"title":"빨갛다 · 红","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n71070-1-7-1","ko":"코가 왜 이렇게 빨개? 꼭 딸기 같아.","zh":"鼻子怎么这么红？简直像草莓一样啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"코가","meaning":"鼻，鼻子","explanation":"코：鼻，鼻子；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"코","audio":"/audio/f4f759edb468db531ae2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"46814","senseId":"1","lemma":"코","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"코가","audio":"/audio/b69d3a69e421dc762018.mp3"}},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么。","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}},{"text":"이렇게","meaning":"这样","explanation":"이렇다：这样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"이렇다","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71157","senseId":"1","lemma":"이렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이렇게","audio":"/audio/9a767a1c9118d82c3af9.mp3"}},{"text":"빨개?","meaning":"红","explanation":"빨갛다：红；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"빨갛다","audio":"/audio/6edc039e433d1613937c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71070","senseId":"1","lemma":"빨갛다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"빨개","audio":"/audio/23963ccdb9e6d40aa0c1.mp3"}},{"text":"꼭","meaning":"仿佛，好像","explanation":"꼭：仿佛，好像。","readings":[{"term":"꼭","audio":"/audio/712da780b7ecf8b736b3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"48064","senseId":"3","lemma":"꼭","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"꼭","audio":"/audio/712da780b7ecf8b736b3.mp3"}},{"text":"딸기","meaning":"草莓","explanation":"딸기：草莓。","readings":[{"term":"딸기","audio":"/audio/8e8964075c066322556d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70787","senseId":"1","lemma":"딸기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}