inese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"밖에","audio":"/audio/b49faf879a59fe63a605.mp3"}},{"text":"날씨가","meaning":"天气","explanation":"날씨：天气；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"날씨","audio":"/audio/fe655cf1d979cf3db76c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60630","senseId":"1","lemma":"날씨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"날씨가","audio":"/audio/7f36def9da34b4ea3404.mp3"}},{"text":"너무","meaning":"太","explanation":"너무：太。","readings":[{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28183","senseId":"1","lemma":"너무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}},{"text":"추워서","meaning":"冷","explanation":"춥다：冷；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"춥다","audio":"/audio/7c651efb56d12a6540a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72146","senseId":"2","lemma":"춥다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"추워서","audio":"/audio/0b67ec971d5347edda2f.mp3"}},{"text":"코가","meaning":"鼻，鼻子","explanation":"코：鼻，鼻子；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"코","audio":"/audio/f4f759edb468db531ae2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"46814","senseId":"1","lemma":"코","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"코가","audio":"/audio/b69d3a69e421dc762018.mp3"}},{"text":"얼었나","meaning":"冻僵","explanation":"얼다：冻僵；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；나：表示疑问或推测内容，常与 보다、싶다 等合用。","readings":[{"term":"얼다","audio":"/audio/483a31bad3d8768e32a5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66572","senseId":"2","lemma":"얼다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"얼었나","audio":"/audio/92d9f20afb332859dd0e.mp3"}},{"text":"봐.","meaning":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","explanation":"보다：看来、好像（根据情况推测）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62249","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"봐","audio":"/audio/fdcffec86114c54dd4e0.mp3